        "pages": [
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "GAME RULES"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• Payouts are made according to the pay table.","",
                        "• Coinciding wins of different symbols are added.","",
                        "• Winning combinations are multiplied by the bet per reel cost.","",
                        "•  ##sym_9.png## symbol could be appears on all reels.","",
                        "• All symbols pay on any position, including scattered ##sym_9.png## .","",
                        "• All values are shown as wins in coins.","",
                        "• The total number of times that the same symbol appear on the combination ","",
                        "   determines the value of the wins."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "FREE GAMES FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The Free Games Feature is triggered when scattered ##sym_9.png## appears","",
                        "   three or more times in a combination.","",
                        "• 15 free games are awarded when 3 or more ##sym_9.png## symbols appear.","",
                        "• Multipliers appear during the Free Games.","",
                        "• Free Game multipliers accumulate and apply to the current win.","",
                        "• Multipliers will only accumulate on a winning free game.","",
                        "• All accumulated multipliers are added together."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "FREE GAMES FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The accumulated multiplier applies only to wins featuring a Multiplier symbol.","",
                        "• The Free Games Feature cannot be retriggered.","",
                        "• Free Games Feature wins are added to payline wins and ##sym_9.png## symbol wins."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "TUMBLE FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The Tumble Feature is triggered when winning occurs in a combination.","",
                        "• All prizes are paid and all winning symbols disappear after the spin.","",
                        "• The remaining symbols go down to the bottom of the screen and the empty ","",
                        "   positions are replaced with symbols coming from above.","",
                        "• The symbols will continue going down until no more winning combinations ","",
                        "   appear as a result of the tumbling. ","",
                        "• There is no maximum limit of possible number of tumbles. "
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "TUMBLE FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The wins of all of the tumbles resulted from a base spin are added to the ","",
                        "   original combination wins.","",
                        "• When a MULTIPLIER appears in a winning combination, the total amount ","",
                        "   obtained during that spin (including all prizes from the Tumble Feature) are multiplied","",
                        "• Multiple Multipliers sum together to multiply the total spin win."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "TUMBLE FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• Whenever a MULTIPLIER symbol lands, it reveals a multiplier value based on the ","",
                        "   current game mode. In the NORMAL GAME, possible values are 2×, 3×, 4×, 5×, 6×, 7×, ","",
                        "   8×, 9× or 10×. During FREE GAMES, possible values are 2×, 3×, 4×, 5×, 6×, 7×, 8×, 9×,","",
                        "   10×, 12×, 15×, 20×, 25×, 50×, 100×, 250×, 500× or 1000×. Multiplier values may vary on ","",
                        "   each spin."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "BUY A FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The cost to purchase this feature is 100x the current total bet.","",
                        "• When a Feature is purchased, 3 ##sym_9.png## symbols will appear and the ","",
                        "   Free Games Feature will be triggered.","",
                        "• Wins from the Buy Feature are added to any payline and ##sym_9.png## symbol wins."
                    ]
                }
            }
        ]
